        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ mwei wa ĩkũmi na ĩlĩ, naw’o nĩ mwei wa Atali, mũthenya wa ĩkũmi na ĩtatũ waw’o, yĩla mwĩao wa mũsumbĩ na ũtw’ĩo wake wathengeee kwĩanĩwa, mũthenya ũla amaitha ma Ayuti meekwatasya methĩwe na ũsumbĩko ĩũlũ wamo (ĩndĩ nĩwasyokie kwĩalyũla, atĩ Ayuti maĩ na ũsumbĩko ĩũlũ wa asu mamamenaa), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
