          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kũmalũlũmĩlya kana masũvĩae mũthenya wa ĩkũmi na ĩna wa mwei wa Atali, na mũthenya wa ĩkũmi na ĩtano waw’o, kĩla mwaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o mĩthenya ĩsu ĩla Ayuti mathũmũie kuma amaithanĩ moo, na mwei ũla wamaalyũkĩle kuma woonĩ kũlika mũyonĩ, na kuma woonĩ mũnene kũlika mũthenya mũseo; nĩ kana mamĩtw’e mĩthenya ya mboka na ya mũyo, na ya kũtwaanĩaa syĩndũ ũmwe na ũla ũngĩ, na mĩthĩnzĩo kwa ngya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Ayuti meetĩkĩla kwĩka ũndũ mambĩlĩlye, na tondũ Molitekai wamaandĩkĩe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
