        {
          "text": "ĩndĩ yĩla ũvoo wavikie vala ve mũsumbĩ, eeaa na mavalũa kana ũsũanĩo ũsu mũthũku, ũla wasũanĩĩe Ayuti, ũsyoke ĩũlũ wa mũtwe wake mwene, na kana we na ana make masũw’e mũtĩnĩ mũtũlu. ",
