          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayuti meeaa, na kwĩyaĩkya ene, na ĩũlũ wa ũsyao woo, na ĩũlũ wa onthe ala meevulanĩtye namo, nĩ kana ũndũ ũsu ndũkaathele, kana makasũvĩaa mĩthenya ĩsu ĩlĩ kwĩanana na ũandĩko wayo, na kwĩanana na kũtw’ĩwa ĩvinda yayo, kĩla mwaka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.27"
            ]
